---
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">How it works</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Four ways in.<br />One output format.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      CLI, REST API, browser extension, or web app — pick whatever fits your workflow.
      All produce the same clean EPUB, delivered to your device.
    </p>

    <div class="ways-grid">
      <div class="way-card way-cli">
        <div class="way-header">
          <div class="way-icon">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="2 4 6 8 2 12"/><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="14" y2="12"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>CLI</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Install with <code>go install</code> or pull the Docker image. Pipe URLs, script it, cron it. No account needed.</p>
        <div class="way-code">
          <span class="cli-p">$</span> savetoink send https://…
        </div>
        <div class="way-code way-code-alt">
          <span class="cli-p">$</span> docker run --rm ghcr.io/savetoink/savetoink-cli:latest send https://…
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="way-card">
        <div class="way-header">
          <div class="way-icon">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M2 5h12M2 8h8M2 11h5"/>
              <path d="M11 9l3 3-3 3"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>REST API</h3>
        </div>
        <p>OpenAPI v3 spec. <code>POST /articles</code> to save, <code>POST /articles/:id/sends</code> to deliver. Integrate with anything.</p>
        <div class="way-tag">OpenAPI v3</div>
      </div>

      <div class="way-card">
        <div class="way-header">
          <div class="way-icon">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="1" y="3" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Browser extension</h3>
        </div>
        <p>One click from Chrome or Firefox. Works with the hosted version or points to your own instance.</p>
        <div class="way-tag">Chrome · Firefox</div>
      </div>

      <div class="way-card">
        <div class="way-header">
          <div class="way-icon">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="2" y="2" width="12" height="12" rx="2"/>
              <path d="M5 6h6M5 9h4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Web app</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Paste a URL, browse your library, re-send or download EPUBs. Self-host it or use ours.</p>
        <div class="way-tag">app.saveto.ink</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pipeline">
      <div class="pipeline-step">
        <p class="ps-label">Fetch</p>
        <p class="ps-desc">Browserless fallback for JS-heavy pages</p>
      </div>
      <p class="ps-arrow">→</p>
      <div class="pipeline-step">
        <p class="ps-label">Distill</p>
        <p class="ps-desc">go-trafilatura strips everything but content</p>
      </div>
      <p class="ps-arrow">→</p>
      <div class="pipeline-step">
        <p class="ps-label">Publish</p>
        <p class="ps-desc">go-epub builds a proper EPUB with metadata</p>
      </div>
      <p class="ps-arrow">→</p>
      <div class="pipeline-step">
        <p class="ps-label">Send</p>
        <p class="ps-desc">Email-to-Kindle · Kobo sideload</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ways-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .way-card {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 4%, var(--paper));
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--card-radius);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .way-card:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, transparent);
  }

  .way-cli {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 30%, transparent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 4%, var(--paper));
  }

  .way-header {
    display: flex !important;
    flex-direction: row !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .way-icon {
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    min-width: 2rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 12%, transparent);
    border-radius: 0.45rem;
    display: flex !important;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .way-card h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .way-card > p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .way-card code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 8%, var(--paper));
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.2rem;
    padding: 0.05rem 0.3rem;
  }

  .way-code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 7%, var(--paper));
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.7rem;
    display: flex !important;
    flex-direction: row !important;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  .way-code:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .way-code-alt {
    opacity: 0.6;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
  }

  .cli-p {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .way-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 100px;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
  }

  /* Pipeline */
  .pipeline {
    display: flex !important;
    flex-direction: row !important;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 3%, var(--paper));
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--card-radius);
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .pipeline-step {
    display: flex !important;
    flex-direction: column !important;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ps-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ps-desc {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.35;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ps-arrow {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1;
    /* nudge up to align with the label row */
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .ways-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ways-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pipeline {
      flex-direction: column !important;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .ps-arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      align-self: center;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .pipeline-step {
      align-items: flex-start !important;
      text-align: left;
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
